@ExpenseHub_Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5245
# troque pelo valor configurado em Seed:Admin:Password (não commite a senha real)
@adminPassword = <senha do seed>

GET {{ExpenseHub_Api_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Login do Admin
# @name adminLogin
POST {{ExpenseHub_Api_HostAddress}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@expensehub.local",
  "password": "{{adminPassword}}"
}

###
@adminToken = {{adminLogin.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Quem sou eu
GET {{ExpenseHub_Api_HostAddress}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Sem token: 401
GET {{ExpenseHub_Api_HostAddress}}/me
